<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Income tax: from gross salary to net pay (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Use the monthly tax table below.</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;margin:6px 0;">
<tr><th style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">Monthly taxable income</th><th style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">Rate</th></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">On the first Ksh 24,000</td><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">10%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">On the next Ksh 8,333</td><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">25%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">On the next Ksh 467,667</td><td style="border:1px solid #888;padding:4px 8px;">30%</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Personal relief: Ksh 2,400 per month.</p>
<p>{@nm@}, a resident employee in {@town@}, earns a gross monthly salary of Ksh \( {@G0@} \). The employer deducts an NSSF contribution of Ksh \( {@N0@} \) before tax is calculated.</p>
<p>(a) Find the monthly taxable income.</p>
<div>Taxable income \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) Find the monthly PAYE, to 2 decimal places.</p>
<div>PAYE \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>
<p>(c) Find the net monthly pay (gross salary minus NSSF and PAYE).</p>
<div>Net pay \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>(a)</strong> Taxable income \( = {@G0@} - {@N0@} = {@TI@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong></p>\[
\begin{align*}
\text{First Ksh } 24{,}000 \text{ at } 10\% &= 2{,}400 \\
\text{Next Ksh } 8{,}333 \text{ at } 25\% &= 2{,}083.25 \\
\text{Remaining Ksh } {@TI - 32333@} \text{ at } 30\% &= {@r2(3/10*(TI - 32333))@} \\
\text{Gross tax} &= {@r2(gt)@}
\end{align*}
\]
<p>PAYE \( = {@r2(gt)@} - 2{,}400 = {@r2(paye)@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(c)</strong> Net pay \( = {@G0@} - {@N0@} - {@r2(paye)@} = {@r2(net)@} \).</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>3</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2025010100</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text><![CDATA[nm : rand(["Mr. Barasa", "Ms. Njeri", "Mr. Mwangi", "Ms. Atieno", "Mr. Kiprop", "Ms. Wambui"]);
r2(v) := if integerp(round(100*v)/100) then round(v) else float(round(100*v)/100);
b1 : 24000;
b2 : 8333;
taxf(ti) := (1/10)*min(ti, b1) + (1/4)*max(0, min(ti, b1 + b2) - b1) + (3/10)*max(0, ti - b1 - b2);
town : rand(["Nairobi", "Mombasa", "Kisumu", "Nakuru", "Eldoret"]);
G0 : 1000*rand([45, 60, 75, 90, 120, 150, 180]);
N0 : rand([1080, 2160]);
TI : G0 - N0;
gt : taxf(TI);
paye : gt - 2400;
net : G0 - N0 - paye;
w_gross : taxf(G0) - 2400;               /* tax on the gross, NSSF ignored */]]></text>
